'''''Sojourners' Ghastly Reverie''''' is a [[Trailblaze Continuance]] in the chapter [[A Foxian Tale of the Haunted]].

==Steps==
# Find the exit of the Illusory Maze
# Search out clues from supernatural stories
# Find the exit of the Illusory Maze
# Meet up with Huohuo
# (Optional) Chat with Cirrus
# (Optional) Chat with Tail
# Chat with Huohuo, and comfort her
# Find the exit of the Illusory Maze
# (Optional) Search out clues from another volume of supernatural stories
# Investigate the strange bronze mirror
# Listen to the voice in the mirror, and determine whether it's real or fake

