==Dialogue==
{{Stub Dialogue}}

===Find the exit of the Illusory Maze{{subst:void|<!--202170201-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Illusory Maze: Furynox|You often see similar news stories about a person getting lost while trying to find another missing person. Unfortunately, today's the day you are destined to be the protagonist of such a story. Gradually, you manage to lose track of even Huohuo. After sizing up a strange bronze mirror for a moment, you are somehow pulled into a realm of illusion. There's walls and doors everywhere, sending you round in circles and disorienting you.<br />According to some of the Xianzhou folk tales you've heard, the outside world will have passed hundreds of years by the time you leave here &mdash; you don't want to spend the rest of your life lost in a maze, so find the exit pronto!}}
