:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Did I really just say that...?)
::'''Cirrus:''' (Hehe... Did you know that the larynx is the easiest muscle to control in the human body?)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Did Guinaifen really get eaten by heliobi?)
